rt?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:35:49Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "What’s the theme?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:35:55Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Or that is to be guessed?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:36:03Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Today’s theme is - some of the most famous elections and their results in world politics", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:36:33Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "You could either be guessing the candidates pitted against each other, or the election year, or just some funda behind it", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:36:36Z", "username": "Das", "text": "Isko bolta hain kehke lena 😀😀", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:36:55Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "12 questions, +10 on correct answer, 0 negs", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:37:00Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "##quiz start", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:37:02Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "First:", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:37:32Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Easy one to begin with:", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:37:47Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "1. For decades, the outcome of elections in this nation was a foregone conclusion, decided by a minority under a